# Adyen SDK-download key — copy this file to `adyen-sdk.properties` (gitignored) and fill it in.
#
# Get it from the Adyen Customer Area: Developers -> API credentials -> a credential with the
# role "Allow SDK download for POS developers". The config plugin reads this at `expo prebuild`
# and injects it as the `adyenSdkApiKey` Gradle property to authenticate Adyen's maven repo.
#
# Never commit the real key. `adyen-sdk.properties` is gitignored; this `.example` is not.
adyenSdkApiKey=
